    dict(key='22-costs', kind='bullets', title='What It Costs',
         body=['A scanner finds only what the cataloguer recognises', 'A bill must be written at every build', 'The vulnerability database ages', 'Most findings are not exploitable here', 'Exceptions need an owner and an end date'],
         narration='Nothing is free. [[slnc 400]] Here is what it costs. [[slnc 500]] A scanner finds only the packages its cataloguer recognises. [[slnc 500]] A bill describes one image, so it must be written at every build. [[slnc 500]] The vulnerability database ages, so old scans must be run again. [[slnc 500]] Findings are many, and most are not exploitable in your use. [[slnc 300]] And each exception needs an owner, and an end date.'),
